  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till regional dialog</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to regional dialogue - Support to regional dialogue NEW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja regional dialog och regionalt samarbete f&#xf6;r fred i MENA. Insatsen verkar f&#xf6;r att minska sp&#xe4;nningar mellan konfliktdrivande parter i regionen, f&#xf6;rebygga eskalering samt st&#xe4;rka f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r regionalt samarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to promote regional dialogue and regional cooperation for peace in the MENA region. The purpose is to contribute to reduce tensions between conflict-driving parties in the region, prevent escalation and strengthen the conditions for regional cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
